<header class="ref-head cen-head"><p class="cty-kicker">History by century · The 600s</p><h1 class="research-title">The 7th century</h1><p class="ref-lede">In the 600s, 318 recorded states existed somewhere in the world. 109 were founded and 61 came to an end. The great powers of the age included the Tang Dynasty, the Kingdom of the Franks and the Byzantine Empire.</p></header>
